---
import ProseLayout from '../../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import Card from '../../components/ds/Card.astro';
---
<ProseLayout
  title="Privacy information"
  metaTitle="Privacy | PumpOS"
  description="Draft privacy information and contact details for the PumpOS pilot."
  path="/legal/privacy"
  eyebrow="PumpOS pilot"
  noindex
>
  <Card as="aside" class="prose-callout" role="note">
    Draft, pending founder approval and legal review. This page is not a final privacy policy and has no effective date yet.
  </Card>
  <h2>Who runs PumpOS</h2>
  <p>The legal operator, jurisdiction and registered address are still to be confirmed. Until then, reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@pumpos.app?subject=Privacy%20question">hello@pumpos.app</a>.</p>
  <h2>Demo visitors</h2>
  <p>If you email us to arrange a demo, we receive your name, station name and contact details. We use them to reply, schedule the demo and discuss the pilot. Please do not send customer records or financial files; the demonstration does not need them.</p>
  <h2>Pilot customers: station records</h2>
  <p>Once a station joins the pilot, it enters operational records into PumpOS, such as shifts, nozzle readings, sales, collections and user accounts. This is separate from demo visitor data. Each organization's data is kept separate from other organizations'. Access is limited to the users the organization authorizes and to PumpOS staff who need it to provide support.</p>
  <h2>Providers that handle data</h2>
  <p>The final list of hosting, authentication, email and scheduling providers, and where data is stored, will be published here once verified. We make no claim about data residency, certifications or compliance until then.</p>
  <h2>Retention, export and deletion</h2>
  <p>Retention periods, export format and deletion procedures for pilot stations are to be decided. Ask us before joining and we will confirm them in writing.</p>
  <h2>Your requests</h2>
  <p>To ask about, correct or delete information you have shared with us, email <a href="mailto:hello@pumpos.app?subject=Privacy%20question">hello@pumpos.app</a>.</p>
  <h2>Open items before publication</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Legal operator name, jurisdiction and verified contact address.</li>
    <li>Confirmed provider and data-flow inventory.</li>
    <li>Retention and deletion periods.</li>
    <li>Review against applicable Indian privacy requirements.</li>
    <li>Effective and revision dates.</li>
  </ul>
</ProseLayout>
